# Artifacts of `./install.sh --project .` — copies of docs/ and agents/ that
# would drift from the source of truth in this repo. `.claude/` is tracked: it
# holds this repo's own maintenance checkers and command, which are never
# installed. Each one is un-ignored by name, so a payload copy landing here can
# never be committed by accident.
/.llmcheats/
/AGENTS.md
/.claude/agents/*
!/.claude/agents/bestpractice-searcher.md
!/.claude/agents/contradiction-checker.md
!/.claude/agents/cost-optimizer.md
!/.claude/agents/drift-detector.md
!/.claude/agents/install-verifier.md
!/.claude/agents/invariant-checker.md
!/.claude/agents/observer.md
!/.claude/agents/routing-prober.md
!/.claude/agents/support-checker.md
/.claude/commands/*
!/.claude/commands/llmcheats.md
/.claude/skills/
/.claude/llmcheats/
